    <profile name="DREAD" id="a4c6-3327-61c2-54a1" hidden="false" typeId="39ba-3647-6510-7709" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power Cost" typeId="1bf9-e90f-6415-1697">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="4502-0f40-9d79-bc93">At any time during your turns.</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b9cf-1e25-5292-ae34">Nominate any one of your Nightstalker models on the table that is not Fatigued. Pick one enemy model within 3” of the nominated Nightstalker. This model must immediately make a Nerve test with a -1 modifier. If the test if failed the model is marked as Activated. Any rules that apply to Nerve tests (e.g. Inspiring) can be used normally. This ability may be used once in each Nightstalker Turn, and is not limited to one use per Round.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="CAUSE FEAR" id="d10c-76ac-638d-6a35" hidden="false" typeId="39ba-3647-6510-7709" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power Cost" typeId="1bf9-e90f-6415-1697">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="4502-0f40-9d79-bc93">When the model activates.</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b9cf-1e25-5292-ae34">All enemy models within 6” of this model must immediately take a Nerve test. Any models that fail are marked as Fatigued.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Shade" id="2fb5-599a-c661-f7c3" hidden="false" typeId="8146-3b99-e6f9-d0a1" typeName=" Warband Member">
